      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ECheshire Pudding (excellent).\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n946. Mix two table-spoonfuls of flour, and the yolks of three eggs with a pint of cream; stir it on the fire till it thickens; sweeten and flavour to taste, pour into a dish and bake. Before sending it to table, grate fine sugar over it, and brown it with a salamander.\u003Cbr\u003E"
